This repository is SOURCE-VISIBLE, not open source.

The code is published so it can be read, studied and discussed: for
transparency about how MMA STATUS obtains and computes its data, and as a
sample of its author's work. Being readable does not make it free to use.

YOU MAY
  - Read and study the code.
  - Quote or discuss it, with attribution.
  - Reuse short excerpts for educational purposes, with attribution.
  - Open issues and propose changes (pull requests are welcome).

YOU MAY NOT, without prior written permission from the copyright holder
  - Use this software, in whole or in part, to run your own service, whether
    free or paid.
  - Copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense or sell copies of
    this software.
  - Use it for commercial purposes, including advertising and affiliate
    marketing.
  - Train machine learning models on this code or on the data it produces.

